# 🦯 Blind AI — Real-Time Assistive Vision System

> An AI-powered assistive vision system designed to help visually impaired users understand and interact with their surroundings through computer vision, voice interaction, scene understanding, and audio feedback.

Blind AI combines multiple perception modules into a single real-time assistant. The system can detect objects, read text, recognize faces, understand gestures and emotions, identify currency, interpret traffic lights, provide navigation-related guidance, and answer questions about the surrounding scene.

---

## ✨ Key Capabilities

### 👁️ Real-Time Object Detection
Detects and identifies objects visible through the camera and provides spoken feedback.

Examples include:

- Laptop
- Mobile phone
- Bottle
- Chair
- Person
- Vehicle
- Other supported objects

### ⚠️ Hazard & Obstacle Awareness
The system prioritizes potentially dangerous objects and obstacles to provide timely audio alerts.

### 📖 OCR — Text Recognition
Reads visible text such as:

- Signs
- Labels
- Menus
- Printed information

### 👤 Face Recognition
Recognizes configured known faces and announces their names.

Known faces can be added through:

```text
data/known_faces/
